  "headline": "Olanzapine is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to a plant with OAI classifications and recent recalls",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E7", "E8", "E11", "E12", "E13"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include olanzapine as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant for olanzapine, Macleods Pharmaceuticals Limited (FEI 3007517881), received OAI classifications after inspections ending 2017-11-24 and 2021-11-01.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E8", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant received a VAI classification after an inspection ending 2023-10-20.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three recalls of olanzapine tablets from this manufacturer are recorded: a Class II recall initiated 2022-02-16 for cGMP deviations, a Class II recall initiated 2024-11-25 for failed impurity specifications on 2.5 mg tablets, and a Class III recall initiated 2026-08-27 for failed impurity specifications on 5 mg tablets.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current on-hand supply across Corvale sites ranges from 11.7 to 28.8 days for 10 mg tablets.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based alternate manufacturer option is to buy from Alkermes, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
